  "prefLabel": "Mid 103.02 Responsibilities of the Council",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 103.02 Responsibilities of the Council. The council’s responsibilities include, but are not limited to:\n\n(a) Establishing qualifications for certification to practice midwifery, renewal of certification, and reinstatement after lapse of certification;\n\n(b) Establishing the requirements for license renewal eligibility, including requirements for continuing education and peer review;\n\n(c) Defining the scope of practice and procedures for the practice of midwifery in accordance with RSA 326-D:5, I(c); and\n\n(d) Any other matters necessary for the proper administration of RSA 326-D.\n\nSource. #7412, eff 12-5-00; ss by #14496, eff 2-8-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mid100.html"
